WEBVTT

00:13.096 --> 00:14.348
What is this?

00:17.184 --> 00:19.227
Am I underwater?

00:22.314 --> 00:23.691
[gasping]

00:25.150 --> 00:26.568
What are these lights?

00:27.068 --> 00:28.278
[gasps]

00:32.157 --> 00:33.659
[SERAFINA] A giant fish?

00:35.452 --> 00:38.121
It's a dragon!

00:38.163 --> 00:40.039
[DRAGON ILLDOREN
in fantasy language]

00:40.081 --> 00:42.626
Sera. I am glad I chose you.

00:43.460 --> 00:45.629
Chose me? [gasps]

00:52.260 --> 00:54.388
Wait! Explain!

00:54.889 --> 00:56.181
[gasps]

00:56.473 --> 00:57.808
[surprised]

00:58.976 --> 01:00.310
It was just a dream?

01:01.645 --> 01:03.230
But why would I?

01:03.731 --> 01:05.607
[SERAFINA] How strange,
a talking dragon.

01:06.107 --> 01:08.193
And an absolutely
massive one at that.

01:08.569 --> 01:10.362
How could I
dream up such a thing?

01:11.154 --> 01:14.366
Did the Morisuberi we killed
invade my dreams somehow?

01:14.408 --> 01:16.243
[VYUFMEC] Get off of me.

01:16.952 --> 01:19.162
You're going to
squeeze my guts out.

01:20.121 --> 01:22.290
[SERAFINA] Oh! Lady Vyufmec?

01:22.666 --> 01:24.501
- [giggles]
- [VYUFMEC groans in pain]

01:29.172 --> 01:32.718
[♪ upbeat music playing,
Mayu Maeshima "Beautiful"]

02:55.592 --> 02:57.636
[general chatter]

02:57.886 --> 02:59.304
[gasps]

03:03.266 --> 03:05.560
Elves and dwarves
straight out of the old legends?

03:06.103 --> 03:08.522
Not to mention those menacing
living plant things.

03:08.563 --> 03:09.773
And fairies!

03:11.316 --> 03:13.234
You are so obnoxious.

03:13.276 --> 03:14.945
Have I lost my mind?

03:14.987 --> 03:17.114
Are all these fantasy
creatures real?

03:17.156 --> 03:18.615
We have been over this.

03:18.657 --> 03:21.326
They are part of the five tribes
I told you about.

03:21.368 --> 03:24.245
And, to remind you again,
they've gathered here so early

03:24.287 --> 03:26.331
to perform
the great cleansing ritual.

03:26.373 --> 03:28.542
[[MALCIUS] Yes,
I comprehend your words.

03:28.583 --> 03:31.920
But do you expect my brain
to accept something this absurd?

03:32.337 --> 03:34.131
I've only known you
a short time,

03:34.173 --> 03:36.884
but it's clear how much
of an unhinged zealot you are.

03:36.925 --> 03:38.385
There's a whole world out there

03:38.426 --> 03:40.219
beyond what your faith
acknowledges.

03:40.595 --> 03:42.430
Try believing your eyes
for a change.

03:42.472 --> 03:43.974
[speechless]

03:44.016 --> 03:46.018
[WYSTERESIA]
Just the one I was looking for!

03:46.060 --> 03:48.227
[MALCIUS] Oh! Who, me,
Saint Wysteresia?

03:48.269 --> 03:51.272
Well, you are the one to blame
for the blight, are you not?

03:52.315 --> 03:54.193
Which means
that you get to participate

03:54.233 --> 03:56.153
in the tradition
of the great cleansing.

03:56.195 --> 03:57.445
Wait, I do?

03:57.487 --> 03:59.406
Though you may
be cleansed yourself,

04:00.032 --> 04:02.117
it's important
that you take accountability.

04:02.159 --> 04:04.036
You need to confront
the consequences

04:04.078 --> 04:05.244
of your actions.

04:05.286 --> 04:06.454
I've been cleansed?

04:07.164 --> 04:09.416
Goodness, she is
rather oblivious, isn't she?

04:09.457 --> 04:11.585
[MALCIUS] I'll show you
oblivion, elf!

04:11.626 --> 04:14.421
Tell me this. What name
did your birth parents give you?

04:15.047 --> 04:16.506
You want to know my name?

04:16.548 --> 04:18.133
Why? To what end?

04:18.175 --> 04:19.300
[VEOR] Humor me, please.

04:19.342 --> 04:20.468
Fine, I guess.

04:20.510 --> 04:21.970
Well, Malcius.

04:22.012 --> 04:23.555
They named me that at the abbey.

04:23.597 --> 04:25.182
That was seven years ago now,

04:25.224 --> 04:27.184
back when I became
a retinue priest.

04:28.267 --> 04:30.478
Hang on.
They definitely called me

04:30.520 --> 04:32.439
something else
at the orphanage, but.

04:33.148 --> 04:34.900
[MALCIUS]
I know I was ordained at 16

04:34.942 --> 04:36.317
because it was unprecedented,

04:36.359 --> 04:37.527
but prior to that.

04:37.569 --> 04:41.406
Those sixteen years.
I. um, I, uh.

04:41.448 --> 04:43.158
You can't recall anything?

04:43.200 --> 04:45.619
That's the majority of your life
and it's just missing?

04:45.660 --> 04:47.537
[MALCIUS] No.
This can't be right!

04:48.247 --> 04:50.373
I can remember the last six, no,

04:50.415 --> 04:52.375
the last seven years
are all there,

04:52.417 --> 04:55.003
but, eight years ago,
there's nothing.

04:55.045 --> 04:56.546
It's, it's disappeared,

04:56.588 --> 04:59.174
there's nothing there,
not a single thing!

04:59.216 --> 05:00.467
Whoa, try to stay calm, Malcius!

05:00.508 --> 05:02.219
It's a side effect
of the blight.

05:02.261 --> 05:03.428
Seriously?

05:03.470 --> 05:05.055
I can understand her distress.

05:05.097 --> 05:07.306
It's quite the miracle
she survived at all.

05:07.348 --> 05:08.558
[VEOR] Very true.

05:08.600 --> 05:10.560
You could argue
the loss of her memories

05:10.602 --> 05:12.062
is a small price to pay.

05:12.437 --> 05:15.149
Though I highly doubt
it feels that way to her.

05:15.190 --> 05:16.483
Same here.

05:16.524 --> 05:18.277
This might sound
a bit harsh, but.

05:18.317 --> 05:20.612
Maybe it wouldn't be
the worst thing for her

05:20.654 --> 05:23.240
to forget her time
as a mindless slave to religion.

05:23.282 --> 05:25.324
[MALCIUS] What?! Excuse me!

05:25.951 --> 05:27.452
Did you say
what I think you did?

05:27.494 --> 05:29.037
You believe I'd be better off

05:29.079 --> 05:31.081
forgetting my devotion
to the Lord?

05:31.123 --> 05:33.416
You! I would never forget that!

05:33.875 --> 05:36.295
Then why don't you quote
a bit of scripture for us?

05:36.335 --> 05:39.256
Actually, just try to remember
an original thought,

05:39.298 --> 05:40.548
if you've ever had any.

05:41.049 --> 05:43.844
[in frustration]
You awful little wench!

05:43.885 --> 05:46.096
Does your mouth
ever stop running?

05:47.181 --> 05:49.308
[CERSEI struggles]
Freckle-faced four-eyes!

05:49.348 --> 05:51.101
[MALCIUS]
First you belittle my faith

05:51.143 --> 05:53.020
and now you attack
my appearance?

05:53.812 --> 05:56.106
They've only known
each other a couple of days

05:56.148 --> 05:57.858
and look at them go.

05:57.899 --> 06:00.235
[SERAFINA] Things can only
get better from here, right?

06:00.277 --> 06:01.987
Should we maybe step in?

06:02.029 --> 06:04.739
I don't think it'll escalate
into any actual violence.

06:06.449 --> 06:08.160
But I will stop them if it does.

06:08.202 --> 06:10.495
Yeah, fight, fight!

06:12.164 --> 06:14.041
I suggest you don't start
any fights

06:14.082 --> 06:15.458
unless you can win them.

06:15.500 --> 06:18.128
You're the one who started it
with your mockery!

06:18.170 --> 06:19.587
[MALCIUS] Little barbarian brat!

06:22.341 --> 06:24.343
[CERSEI struggles]

06:24.383 --> 06:27.386
Don't mess with an Eastern
Expedition priest!

06:27.428 --> 06:30.015
I'm super fit
from marching night and day!

06:30.057 --> 06:32.184
[in pain]

06:32.226 --> 06:35.729
You got the drop on me,
but who's on top now, huh?

06:35.770 --> 06:39.024
So you think I'm better off
without my memories of my faith?

06:39.066 --> 06:40.567
Then I'll forget to show mercy!

06:41.068 --> 06:42.569
I truly despise everything

06:42.610 --> 06:44.487
the Order
of Commoneras symbolizes.

06:44.529 --> 06:46.365
But, I have received
some charity

06:46.405 --> 06:47.908
from them once before.

06:47.949 --> 06:49.784
[MALCIUS gasps]

06:49.826 --> 06:52.079
Listen up! I don't know why
I didn't mention this earlier,

06:52.120 --> 06:54.455
but this barbaric wannabe
is a big faker!

06:54.497 --> 06:55.707
She's actually-—

07:03.840 --> 07:05.217
It's over now.

07:06.051 --> 07:07.510
Heathen-—

07:08.303 --> 07:10.013
[straining]

07:12.182 --> 07:13.975
- [sighs]
- [bell chimes]

07:15.102 --> 07:17.020
We have ourselves
a winner, folks!

07:17.312 --> 07:20.148
Great, guess I'll have to
carry Malcius. [sighs]

07:20.732 --> 07:22.943
Hey, in that case,
why don't you and Cersei

07:22.984 --> 07:24.152
haul her down to the river?

07:24.194 --> 07:25.320
Huh?

07:25.362 --> 07:26.529
You've still got plenty of time

07:26.571 --> 07:28.407
before
the great cleansing starts.

07:28.447 --> 07:29.866
And the three of you?

07:29.908 --> 07:31.534
You could do
with some cleansing too.

07:31.576 --> 07:32.994
A good suggestion.

07:33.036 --> 07:34.329
A pleasant dip in the river

07:34.371 --> 07:36.581
will help you feel refreshed
for the ritual.

07:36.623 --> 07:38.292
[SERAFINA] Um, are you sure?

07:38.333 --> 07:40.919
They won't be needing
your help with the preparations.

07:41.502 --> 07:43.922
And y'know,
what else do you have to do?

07:43.964 --> 07:45.257
Right.

07:45.299 --> 07:46.633
[WYSTERESIA laughs]
Don't feel bad!

07:47.050 --> 07:48.927
I'm skipping out
on the whole ritual,

07:48.969 --> 07:51.430
going to spend the time
relaxing at my nephew's house.

07:52.139 --> 07:54.433
- Shit. I'm too old!
- [SERAFINA] Oh, come on, Resia.

07:54.473 --> 07:56.435
All right,
you heard her, Cersei.

07:56.475 --> 07:58.353
See them
to the river once she's up.

07:58.395 --> 07:59.646
Oh, yes, sir.

08:02.065 --> 08:03.317
I'm sure you wondered

08:03.358 --> 08:05.068
what this fanatic
was about to say

08:05.110 --> 08:06.403
before I choked her out.

08:07.528 --> 08:10.157
The truth is,
I am originally from Illdoren.

08:10.198 --> 08:12.451
I was a member
of the Eastern Cultivation Corps

08:12.491 --> 08:13.994
that came here six years ago.

08:14.244 --> 08:15.578
I'd suspected.

08:15.620 --> 08:18.457
Your animosity
toward nobles runs deep.

08:18.497 --> 08:21.460
And, I also noticed that you
referred to me as a knight

08:21.500 --> 08:23.086
instead of a warrior.

08:23.586 --> 08:26.131
Although, it still doesn't
explain your skill

08:26.173 --> 08:27.799
at equipping a knight's armor.

08:28.300 --> 08:30.551
I doubt you learned that
in the Cultivation Corps.

08:31.094 --> 08:33.138
I'd ask you
not to press any further.

08:33.180 --> 08:35.974
I've left that whole country
and life far behind.

08:36.099 --> 08:37.351
This is my home now.

08:37.392 --> 08:40.187
I am Cersei,
Master Veor's loyal attendant.

08:41.396 --> 08:43.898
I treat you as the woman
my master's chosen to court,

08:43.940 --> 08:45.192
not a noble or knight.

08:45.233 --> 08:47.027
So please
don't start treating me

08:47.068 --> 08:48.236
as a citizen of Illdoren.

08:48.278 --> 08:49.446
[gasps]

08:49.988 --> 08:51.323
I'd never do that.

08:52.115 --> 08:54.075
[SERAFINA]
Although I do see your point.

08:54.117 --> 08:55.452
And I'll respect it.

08:57.454 --> 08:59.706
- But.
- [CERSEI] What is it?

09:00.248 --> 09:02.125
If you don't mind my asking,

09:02.667 --> 09:04.543
are the memories
you have of our homeland

09:04.585 --> 09:06.380
ones you'd rather forget?

09:06.421 --> 09:07.546
[breathing]

09:07.964 --> 09:11.051
[sentiment piano music]

09:11.385 --> 09:13.428
Actually, it's more like

09:13.470 --> 09:15.514
I barely remember
the place, anyway.

09:15.554 --> 09:17.432
And haven't bothered trying to.

09:17.474 --> 09:18.808
[CERSEI] There's no point

09:18.850 --> 09:20.477
since I never plan
on going back.

09:24.105 --> 09:25.648
How?

09:25.690 --> 09:28.068
The lord protects me,
yet I felt so helpless.

09:28.109 --> 09:29.486
Losing a fight never feels good,

09:29.528 --> 09:31.570
but someone
had to snap you out of it,

09:31.612 --> 09:33.656
and at least you're not
in shock anymore.

09:34.324 --> 09:36.951
I wasn't catatonic,
I was just a little overwhelmed.

09:36.993 --> 09:38.995
Looked like
you were gonna mutter forever.

09:39.037 --> 09:40.914
- Same way you are now.
- That's it.

09:40.955 --> 09:42.999
I've had it with you! [fuming]

09:43.333 --> 09:45.460
Can we please
keep this civil, Malcius?

09:45.502 --> 09:46.961
I am civil!

09:47.003 --> 09:49.214
But I don't understand
why I'm being dragged

09:49.256 --> 09:51.216
on an errand
with this violent savage!

09:51.258 --> 09:53.927
Nothing will keep me
from your side, Lady Serafina,

09:53.968 --> 09:56.263
so I'll tolerate
this barbarian, if I must!

09:56.304 --> 09:57.889
But can you tell me why?

09:57.931 --> 09:59.307
You smell terrible, that's why.

09:59.349 --> 10:01.142
What?!

10:01.184 --> 10:02.894
No, you're wrong, I can't stink!

10:02.936 --> 10:04.145
You're just being mean!

10:04.187 --> 10:06.647
Take it back!

10:07.107 --> 10:09.234
Well, sorry. But you're rank.

10:09.734 --> 10:11.945
I know it's hard
to notice your own scent.

10:11.986 --> 10:14.114
[CERSEI] But it's a sour mix
of blood, sweat,

10:14.155 --> 10:15.656
and a trace of gross perfume.

10:16.283 --> 10:18.076
I'm guessing
you can't even remember

10:18.118 --> 10:19.618
the last time that you bathed.

10:21.079 --> 10:22.705
What? Of course, I do!

10:22.747 --> 10:24.874
[MALCIUS]
It would have been four days

10:24.916 --> 10:27.168
before Lady Serafina
served as the vanguard

10:27.210 --> 10:29.254
and was captured
by you barbarians,

10:29.296 --> 10:31.005
so that would make it, uhh.

10:31.214 --> 10:34.551
[hyperventilating]

10:35.302 --> 10:37.554
[MALCIUS] Over half a month.

10:40.098 --> 10:42.267
Malcius, sorry.

10:42.309 --> 10:45.061
You know,
there was never a good time.

10:45.103 --> 10:47.522
I really wanted to tell you,
but I wasn't sure how.

10:48.106 --> 10:49.232
[SERAFINA] Forgive me.

10:49.274 --> 10:50.609
It's all right.

10:53.111 --> 10:55.071
[SERAFINA]
And hey, you're not alone.

10:55.113 --> 10:56.281
I've worked up a sweat

10:56.323 --> 10:58.199
over these last three days
as well.

10:59.033 --> 11:01.161
So yes,
it's actually good timing.

11:01.911 --> 11:05.039
Just to be safe, I'm going to
keep my sword at arm's length.

11:05.499 --> 11:08.042
Fine, but we're highly unlikely
to see any monsters.

11:11.087 --> 11:12.589
[stretching]

11:13.672 --> 11:15.509
So this entire area
surrounding the village?

11:16.009 --> 11:18.011
Yeah,
it's Master Veor's territory.

11:18.052 --> 11:20.263
Most of the dragons know
it's best to avoid it.

11:20.305 --> 11:21.431
But "most" isn't "all,"

11:21.473 --> 11:23.724
and yet you still risk
bathing here?

11:23.766 --> 11:27.228
Well, everywhere else would be
actual dragon territory.

11:27.270 --> 11:30.398
I figured you might have picked
up on that in the western woods.

11:30.440 --> 11:32.651
Please, can we go back home now?

11:33.234 --> 11:35.278
I'm sorry,
but I'm afraid we can't.

11:38.239 --> 11:41.075
[SERAFINA] I sincerely meant
what I told you before.

11:41.117 --> 11:44.245
I have no intention of leaving
this place anytime soon.

11:44.496 --> 11:45.788
[forlorn]

11:46.540 --> 11:48.791
I suggest scrubbing down
quick as you can.

11:48.833 --> 11:51.336
[SERAFINA] Take too long
and you'll catch a chill.

11:53.213 --> 11:54.506
[MALCIUS] All right.

11:57.551 --> 11:59.344
What are you doing with that?

11:59.594 --> 12:00.637
[breathing]

12:04.307 --> 12:07.435
[gentle music playing]

12:10.063 --> 12:13.567
It doesn't get much better
than a campfire after a bath.

12:14.359 --> 12:16.486
Agreed. It is kind of hard
to enjoy being clean

12:16.528 --> 12:18.821
when you're on the verge
of freezing to death

12:18.863 --> 12:20.031
from the river.

12:20.073 --> 12:21.658
The warmth is quite nice.

12:22.325 --> 12:24.743
[SERAFINA gasps] I think
they should be done by now.

12:27.080 --> 12:28.665
[CERSEI]
Yep. Looks like they are.

12:37.382 --> 12:38.883
Oh, it's good.

12:38.925 --> 12:40.510
- [loud screech]
- [MALCIUS gasps]

12:44.389 --> 12:45.682
[MALCIUS gasps]

12:47.100 --> 12:49.561
The great cleansing
will be starting soon.

12:49.603 --> 12:51.145
We'd best be on our way.

12:53.106 --> 12:55.567
[BALHATH] It's a lucky thing
the blight was purged

12:55.609 --> 12:57.318
as quickly as it was, you know?

12:57.360 --> 12:58.945
[GUAS] Yeah, it's a lot easier

12:58.986 --> 13:00.572
to set up
and pull off the cleansing

13:00.614 --> 13:02.240
if it's still in its cocoon.

13:02.282 --> 13:04.659
I heard it was the bride-to-be
who took it down.

13:04.701 --> 13:07.120
[GUAS] Bold woman, that.
I couldn't do it!

13:07.161 --> 13:09.788
How has the story spread so much
in a single day?

13:09.830 --> 13:11.625
It's crazy.

13:11.666 --> 13:13.501
No, what's crazy is how hard
we worked to make it happen.

13:13.543 --> 13:15.836
- When?
- Oh, that's right.

13:15.878 --> 13:17.631
I guess you wouldn't
have noticed,

13:17.672 --> 13:19.215
since you were still unconscious

13:19.257 --> 13:21.092
from Malcius
landing on your head.

13:21.134 --> 13:23.386
For the record,
I'm not usually that careless!

13:23.428 --> 13:25.597
[SERAFINA]
And I wasn't wearing a helmet!

13:25.639 --> 13:28.099
I mean, honestly,
who wouldn't be a bit out of it

13:28.141 --> 13:29.684
after slaying that monster?

13:31.936 --> 13:34.063
Fair enough,
you make an excellent point.

13:34.105 --> 13:36.483
So, anyway!
While Illdoren was knocked out,

13:36.524 --> 13:38.526
we were busy
flying all over the place,

13:38.568 --> 13:41.321
and I'm still totally
exhausted from it!

13:41.362 --> 13:42.863
Right, I'm sure you are.

13:42.905 --> 13:44.616
We appreciate
the effort, though.

13:44.658 --> 13:46.451
Nah, the truth is,
I don't even know

13:46.493 --> 13:48.328
what exhaustion feels like.

13:49.120 --> 13:52.165
The Tefyu are,
well, like fragments of nature.

13:52.206 --> 13:55.126
So they perceive things a bit
differently than the rest of us.

13:55.168 --> 13:57.337
For example,
she might have some difficulty

13:57.378 --> 13:59.213
in telling Cersei
and Malcius apart.

13:59.255 --> 14:00.881
Really?

14:00.923 --> 14:02.592
That seems more than just
a "bit different to me.

14:03.635 --> 14:05.553
Hmm. I know
who the important people are,

14:05.595 --> 14:06.971
so what's it matter?

14:07.013 --> 14:08.931
That sounds more
like lack of interest

14:08.973 --> 14:10.099
than lack of ability.

14:12.143 --> 14:13.645
[VAS] And we've arrived!

14:15.188 --> 14:16.897
[GUAS] Would you look at that.

14:16.939 --> 14:18.525
[BALHATH]
What a mess, how awful.

14:18.857 --> 14:19.984
[gasps]

14:25.990 --> 14:29.118
[gentle music playing]

14:36.083 --> 14:38.127
So this is all that's left.

14:38.503 --> 14:40.171
It's like this part
of the forest

14:40.213 --> 14:41.631
has been emptied of color.

14:50.431 --> 14:51.641
White dust.

14:51.683 --> 14:53.309
Everything's turned to dust.

14:55.269 --> 14:57.522
It looks like the area
where we fought the Fiend

14:57.564 --> 14:59.148
has been sucked dry.

14:59.733 --> 15:02.235
[VEOR] Another devastating
effect of the blight.

15:02.694 --> 15:05.154
In the same way
that we all possess a will,

15:05.196 --> 15:08.533
so too do the earth,
wind, water, and fire.

15:09.242 --> 15:11.452
All wills are
fundamentally similar,

15:11.494 --> 15:14.038
except for one
important distinction.

15:14.080 --> 15:15.790
There's a divide.

15:15.832 --> 15:18.251
A line drawn between living
creatures and the elements.

15:18.626 --> 15:21.087
[VEOR] When a finite life
is depleted of willpower,

15:21.128 --> 15:22.672
it's simply gone from the world.

15:23.005 --> 15:24.340
But nature?

15:24.382 --> 15:27.385
Its willpower never ends,
but stagnates.

15:27.427 --> 15:30.096
It forgets what it was
and turns to dust.

15:31.598 --> 15:34.517
Um, those are the words
of our Rijutsushi here.

15:34.559 --> 15:36.436
Karka taught me that
a few years back.

15:36.477 --> 15:38.396
[smirks] Hello!

15:38.438 --> 15:40.857
[SERAFINA] It sounded like he
knew what he was talking about.

15:40.899 --> 15:42.233
He definitely sold it.

15:42.941 --> 15:45.612
Really, I can delve into
much greater detail if you like.

15:46.696 --> 15:49.948
But first things first,
the person who caused this mess,

15:50.408 --> 15:52.577
I would like to see
the tool they used to do it.

15:55.622 --> 15:56.790
[VEOR] Here it is.

15:59.166 --> 16:01.795
Hey, get your dirty hands
off my scripture!

16:01.836 --> 16:03.045
[MALCIUS] Give it ba-—

16:03.087 --> 16:04.963
Thieves! Get off of me!

16:06.382 --> 16:09.260
It's a rijutsu text focused on
converting things to light,

16:09.302 --> 16:11.596
which can be channeled
as heat or impact.

16:11.638 --> 16:13.180
Thought that might be the case.

16:13.556 --> 16:16.142
[KARKA] Yes,
it's barren of all artistry.

16:16.183 --> 16:17.351
What, that?

16:17.644 --> 16:19.312
It sure felt well-crafted.

16:19.353 --> 16:21.439
It was clearly capable
of serious damage

16:21.481 --> 16:23.357
if one wasn't wearing armor.

16:23.399 --> 16:24.525
[KARKA] Oh, I believe it.

16:24.567 --> 16:26.486
That's evident
from the willpower

16:26.527 --> 16:27.986
it drained from the land.

16:28.028 --> 16:30.030
There's no arguing
against its potency.

16:30.615 --> 16:32.241
But from our point of view,

16:32.283 --> 16:35.411
the very idea of using rijutsu
for destruction is crude.

16:35.453 --> 16:37.163
The act of an imbecile.

16:37.204 --> 16:38.331
Huh?

16:39.457 --> 16:42.000
[KARKA] Now then, the sun is
quickly approaching noon.

16:42.669 --> 16:45.045
We couldn't ask
for more lovely weather today.

16:45.087 --> 16:47.465
Perfect conditions
to wake up the land, I'd say.

16:47.924 --> 16:50.384
[upbeat music]

16:54.681 --> 16:57.015
- What are those?
- They're called catalysts.

16:57.600 --> 16:59.477
[KARKA]
Provided by the different clans.

16:59.519 --> 17:03.397
There's earth, water,
fire, and wind, of course.

17:03.439 --> 17:05.525
A catalyst to nourish
each element.

17:05.566 --> 17:07.485
Along with a prayer
to remind the land

17:07.527 --> 17:08.945
of its true nature.

17:09.487 --> 17:12.532
[instrumental
folk music playing]

17:24.002 --> 17:25.294
We're set to begin.

17:38.933 --> 17:40.977
In the name
of the mighty spirits,

17:41.019 --> 17:43.270
we will now perform
the great cleansing.

17:43.312 --> 17:45.523
[drumbeats]

17:46.691 --> 17:49.777
[speaking fantasy language]

17:50.904 --> 17:52.572
Something about his words,

17:53.113 --> 17:55.199
the way they traveled
over the depleted earth,

17:55.241 --> 17:56.951
so soft yet booming.

17:57.660 --> 18:00.204
[SERAFINA] They sounded older
than any language I've heard.

18:01.039 --> 18:05.960
[KARKA speaking
fantasy language]

18:06.586 --> 18:10.006
[SERAFINA] A call for life,
for purification.

18:10.673 --> 18:13.051
Passed down
for countless millennia.

18:15.929 --> 18:20.975
[KARKA speaking
fantasy language]

18:25.312 --> 18:28.649
[SERAFINA] Banishing calamity,
and purging blight.

18:28.691 --> 18:33.279
A prayer for all that's pure
to scrub iniquity from creation.

18:36.616 --> 18:39.117
A call for a great cleansing.

18:39.452 --> 18:43.039
[VEOR yells]

18:45.374 --> 18:48.711
[dramatic music]

18:50.421 --> 18:51.756
[in awe]

18:56.928 --> 18:59.639
[VEOR struggling]

19:02.892 --> 19:04.226
[gasps]

19:05.061 --> 19:08.397
[panting]

19:09.107 --> 19:10.566
[sighs]

19:13.277 --> 19:14.988
[VEOR] That should do the trick.

19:17.573 --> 19:20.200
So how was your first
great cleansing, Sera?

19:21.119 --> 19:23.121
[gasps, cries]

19:25.039 --> 19:26.164
Sera?

19:30.419 --> 19:32.463
[VEOR]
Were you really that moved?

19:39.137 --> 19:40.220
[sighs]

19:40.972 --> 19:42.431
All right, that makes thirty.

19:44.142 --> 19:47.561
[gentle folk music playing]

19:52.483 --> 19:54.944
The idea of a Lavillant woman
planting trees

19:54.986 --> 19:56.570
should have been unimaginable.

19:57.030 --> 19:58.405
But it's not bad at all.

20:00.282 --> 20:03.201
[SERAFINA] I can't say I was
expecting such a mystical ritual

20:03.243 --> 20:05.579
to be followed
by community labor, though.

20:07.081 --> 20:09.542
I could be wrong, but you appear
to be a bit puzzled.

20:09.876 --> 20:11.002
Oh, I do?

20:11.044 --> 20:12.294
I guess I was just thinking

20:12.336 --> 20:14.547
about how all of this
feels so ordinary.

20:14.797 --> 20:16.132
Well, it is.

20:16.507 --> 20:19.259
It takes some ordinary work
to heal a forest.

20:19.593 --> 20:21.219
[VEOR] The ritual was the seed,

20:21.261 --> 20:24.515
but now we have to tend to it,
or the forest will be lost.

20:24.932 --> 20:28.268
And that would be trouble for us
and future generations.

20:29.187 --> 20:30.396
That's what matters.

20:30.437 --> 20:32.439
We have to think of the future.

20:32.481 --> 20:34.692
[VEOR] To care only
about individual concerns

20:34.734 --> 20:37.403
in the present is
to reject our shared fate.

20:37.444 --> 20:39.572
It's what gives rise
to the blight.

20:41.281 --> 20:43.201
At their core,
Fiends are avatars

20:43.241 --> 20:45.203
of greed and self-interest.

20:45.243 --> 20:47.371
If I may interject a bit, Veor.

20:47.413 --> 20:49.623
In the current case,
the land was drained

20:49.665 --> 20:52.250
of its willpower
in order to fuel a spell.

20:52.292 --> 20:54.336
[KARKA] And once robbed
of its stability,

20:54.378 --> 20:55.880
the land drained the memories

20:55.922 --> 20:57.590
and will of the caster
in return.

20:58.091 --> 21:00.051
It takes that much in exchange?

21:00.093 --> 21:02.469
The land's severe
with its retribution, huh?

21:02.511 --> 21:04.388
[KARKA]
Oh, it doesn't play lightly.

21:04.847 --> 21:07.808
I'd say it's worse than death.
Being drained of all you are?

21:07.850 --> 21:09.560
No, thank you.

21:09.602 --> 21:12.479
So, Malcius? That's really
how she lost her memories?

21:13.231 --> 21:15.233
Yes, that's indeed how it works.

21:15.482 --> 21:17.193
She's quite fortunate, though.

21:17.235 --> 21:19.570
[KARKA] It would normally
leave nothing but a husk.

21:19.612 --> 21:21.655
Most people aren't
lucky enough to be freed

21:21.697 --> 21:23.365
before they're fully drained.

21:23.407 --> 21:25.492
But ones who are,
it's common in our culture

21:25.534 --> 21:27.536
to view them
as having been cleansed.

21:30.623 --> 21:32.541
Trying to help me now?

21:34.961 --> 21:36.754
[CERSEI]
Your name is Malcius, right?

21:38.965 --> 21:42.051
This may surprise you,
but I recognize that surname.

21:42.093 --> 21:44.220
It's given to children
raised in the orphanage

21:44.262 --> 21:46.304
attached to
the Order's Malcius Abbey.

21:48.015 --> 21:50.643
I do think you're better off
forgetting what came before.

21:51.309 --> 21:53.020
Your life before the order,

21:53.062 --> 21:55.982
and the life you must've
endured in that orphanage.

21:56.523 --> 21:58.316
For now, you should only think

21:58.358 --> 22:00.402
about the act
of planting those saplings.

22:02.071 --> 22:03.739
That's another form
of cleansing.

22:12.165 --> 22:15.209
[♪ upbeat music playing,
Sajou no Hana "Shirubeki Koto"]

22:18.378 --> 22:20.840
- Hey, Veor.
- Uh-huh.

22:20.881 --> 22:22.091
I get it now.

22:22.133 --> 22:24.426
I understand
why the blight's so wretched.

22:25.178 --> 22:26.595
And why you work to fight it.

22:27.554 --> 22:29.056
I see.

22:29.598 --> 22:31.100
[SERAFINA] Not only that.

22:31.225 --> 22:32.392
The eastern land,

22:33.186 --> 22:36.022
the relationship between people
and nature here.

22:36.522 --> 22:38.440
I think I understand it too,

22:39.066 --> 22:41.110
and what you're trying
to accomplish.

22:46.448 --> 22:47.491
[VEOR] I'm glad.
